# Grub Roulette project standards

Before writing or changing code in this repo, read and follow the project skills:

- `.cursor/skills/code-style/SKILL.md`: Biome lint/format rules, TypeScript and naming conventions
- `.cursor/skills/app-patterns/SKILL.md`: architecture, frontend/backend patterns, dependency policy
- `.cursor/skills/ci-cd-deploy/SKILL.md`: required when touching workflows, Docker, scripts, releases, or deploys

After every change:

1. `npm run lint:fix` (Biome: format, organize imports, sort Tailwind classes, safe fixes)
2. `npm run check` (lint + typecheck + build) must pass

If a skill is wrong or out of date, update the skill in the same change, so it stays the source of truth.
